# Immutable DrugRef source revision used by carlos-emr-drugref builds.
# This revision migrates DrugRef to MariaDB Connector/J 3.5.11, preserving
# legacy driver/URL configuration, temporal and alias metadata behavior,
# DPD recovery, and orderly pool/driver shutdown. It is paired with
# debian/drugref-dependencies-lock.json and the staged-WAR JDBC contract.
# It also keeps Connector/J's yes/no values for every MariaDB Boolean option
# in jdbc:mysql: configuration (#5969), on top of the MariaDB migration
# (93775a0, carlos-emr/drugref2026#18).
#
# It descends from master 57c8642 and retains the earlier allergy safety,
# recoverable DPD replacement, missing-DIN lookup, SQL-date XML-RPC, and
# EntityManager lifecycle fixes. Do not move the pin behind those changes.
# Build from this full commit SHA; branch names are not reproducible.
